  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tablespoon of vegetable oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the diced onion and cook until translucent, 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the cherry tomatoes and cook until they start to release their juices, 2-3 minutes.",
    "Add the shredded chicken and cook until heated through, 2-3 minutes.",
    "Add the dry sherry and cook until the liquid is almost completely absorbed, 1-2 minutes.",
    "Add the cooked rice and stir to combine with the chicken and vegetables.",
    "Transfer the rice mixture to a serving platter and garnish with cilantro and sesame seeds if using.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
